Z||000000||Alex2004||01-27-2001||06:21 PM||||we are thinking of buying an aftermarket subwoofer and i want it to be in the footwell. But, what all am i going to have to do in building a box for it there, it will be a 10" or an 8". And am i going to need the overhead consol thingy with the subwoofer swtich on it?  Let me know! Thanks.<P>          Alex...PS, if you have any pics of subwoofer boxes you have made for the fiero that would help alot!<p>[This message has been edited by Alex2004 (edited 01-27-2001).]||||reg||10
Z||000001||Oreif||01-27-2001||06:58 PM||||Do a search for "footwell subs" to see the pics of 8" and 10". The overhead subwoofer switch is only for the factory subwoofer.||||reg||1
